trait PeriodicGeometriesVisual:
    .doc: """
    Defines the visual geometries of the track links as a periodic array of geometries,
    allowing for more complex shapes and variations in the visual representation of the links.
    The list of visuals is periodic and will cycle until all links in the track are covered.

    Example:
    Two alternating geometries, a cylinder and a box, are defined as visual geometries for the links.

    Cylinder is Visuals.Geometries.Cylinder:
        radius: 0.05 / 2
        height: 0.5

    Box is Visuals.Geometries.Box:
        size: { 0.5, 0.1, 0.1 }

    Link is TrackSystem.Components.Tracks.LinkDescription.Box:
        with TrackSystem.Components.Tracks.Traits.PeriodicGeometriesVisual
        width: 0.5
        height: 0.05
        visual_geometries: [Cylinder, Box]
"""
    visual_geometries is Visuals.Node[]
